Upstream Attribution
--------------------
This project originated as a fork and native rewrite of ElloboDK/KeyCat
(https://github.com/ElloboDK/KeyCat). The original visual design concept,
interaction ideas, and early macOS shell structure are credited to ElloboDK.
The Rust core engine (crates/core, crates/ffi), Windows Direct3D 11 /
DirectComposition / Direct2D implementation (apps/windows), and macOS Metal
renderer (apps/macos) were written or rewritten for KeyCat Slim.

As noted in the upstream project, the cat character concept is intended for
personal use and learning rather than commercial redistribution.

